  32:../../../chompi-wave/code/libs/libDaisy/src/hid/usb_midi.h ****          * When sending MIDI messages immediately back-to-back in user code,
  33:../../../chompi-wave/code/libs/libDaisy/src/hid/usb_midi.h ****          * sometimes the USB CDC driver is still "busy".
