 334:OrganEngine.h ****              * anchors a 1/3-full-scale input to the same output level, so
 335:OrganEngine.h ****              * turning the knob up adds crunch/compression instead of just
 336:OrganEngine.h ****              * loudness; step 0 is an exact bypass. Runs before the master
