 387:OrganEngine.h ****     /** Easing applied within each half of the morph (sine->square and
 388:OrganEngine.h ****      *  square->saw). Smoothstep: flat ends make the blend linger near the
 389:OrganEngine.h ****      *  pure waveforms. For an even longer sine-land use t*t; for less
 390:OrganEngine.h ****      *  easing, blend toward linear: .5f*(t + t*t*(3.f - 2.f*t)). */
